  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Muhammed Akhtar Zaman is a Swedish international technology entrepreneur known professionally as M. A. Zaman. He held senior Asia-Pacific responsibilities at Millicom and Kinnevik and became founding chairman and a shareholder of Cambodia’s mobile operator CamGSM. He later founded 6G AI Sweden, developing infrastructure for artificial-intelligence computing and cloud services.",
